<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106120" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕαιν-ᾰ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, ἡ, prop. a fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς</span>: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> the striped <i>hyena,</i> a
			carnivorous animal with a bristly mane like a hog
			(whence the name), <i>Hyaena striata,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.192
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				579b15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.263
			</span></i>; also called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλάνος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				594a31
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κροκόττας.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of antelope, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				15.15
			</span></i> (s.v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a
			sea-fish, <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.326f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				13.27
			</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑαινίς</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				65
			</span></i>; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑαίνας</span> is most prob. an error for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεαίνας,</span> as the corresponding
			masc. is <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέοντες.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
